## 9. RECOVERY CODES (Win-back Inactive Customers)

### COMEBACK20
```
Type: Percentage Discount
Value: 20% off
Applies to: Customers inactive 30+ days
Min order: 40,000đ
Max discount: 25,000đ
Valid: 7 days after receiving code
Usage limit: 1 time

Marketing copy:
