## 10. LOYALTY PROGRAM (STAMP CARD)

### "Mua 10 Tặng 1"

**How it works:**
- Customer gets digital stamp after each order
- After 10 stamps → Free meal (up to 50,000đ value)
- Stamps tracked in app/Zalo/manual card

**Rules:**
- 1 stamp per order (min 35,000đ)
- Stamps expire after 90 days
- Free meal must be redeemed within 30 days

