- **Order Time**: Avg. customer order time < 2 minutes.
- **Kitchen Latency**: Time from "Order Placed" to "Kitchen View" < 5 seconds.
- **Error Rate**: Order correction rate < 1%.
- **Uptime**: System availability > 99.9% during operating hours.
