# Metrics & KPIs - Cơm Ánh Dương

**Document Type:** Performance Metrics & Key Performance Indicators
**Version:** 1.0
**Last Updated:** 2026-01-31

---

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

This document defines success metrics for Cơm Ánh Dương's marketing and business operations. Metrics are tracked daily, weekly, and monthly to ensure business growth and profitability.

**Primary Business Goal:** Achieve 300 orders/day by Month 6 (9,000 orders/month)

---

## 1. REVENUE METRICS

### 1.1 Monthly Revenue Targets

| Month | Orders/Day | Orders/Month | Avg Order Value | Revenue Target | Status |
|-------|-----------|--------------|-----------------|----------------|--------|
| 1 (Launch) | 30 | 900 | 40,000đ | 36,000,000đ | 🎯 |
| 2 | 60 | 1,800 | 42,000đ | 75,600,000đ | 🎯 |
| 3 | 100 | 3,000 | 45,000đ | 135,000,000đ | 🎯 |
| 4 | 150 | 4,500 | 45,000đ | 202,500,000đ | 🎯 |
| 5 | 220 | 6,600 | 47,000đ | 310,200,000đ | 🎯 |
| 6 | 300 | 9,000 | 50,000đ | 450,000,000đ | 🎯 |

**Total Year 1 Revenue Target:** ~2.4 tỷ đồng

---

### 1.2 Revenue Breakdown by Source

| Channel | Month 1 (%) | Month 3 (%) | Month 6 (%) |
|---------|-------------|-------------|-------------|
| Organic (Word-of-mouth, SEO) | 20% | 35% | 45% |
| Paid Ads (Facebook, Google) | 50% | 30% | 20% |
| Referral Program | 10% | 20% | 20% |
| Partnerships (Offices) | 20% | 15% | 15% |

**Insight:** Giảm dependency vào paid ads, tăng organic growth

---

### 1.3 Average Order Value (AOV) Optimization

**Current AOV:** 40,000đ (1 suất cơm)

**Target AOV Increase:**
- Month 1-2: 40,000đ
- Month 3-4: 45,000đ (+12.5%) via combo upsells
- Month 5-6: 50,000đ (+25%) via bundles + add-ons

**Tactics:**
- Suggest "Thêm trứng/chả" (+5k)
- Combo 2 người (80k instead of 2x40k)
- "Mua 2 giảm 10%"

---

## 2. CUSTOMER ACQUISITION METRICS

### 2.1 Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)

**Formula:** Total Marketing Spend / New Customers Acquired

| Month | Marketing Spend | New Customers | CAC | Target |
|-------|----------------|---------------|-----|--------|
| 1 | 20,000,000đ | 300 | 66,667đ | ≤70,000đ |
| 3 | 20,000,000đ | 500 | 40,000đ | ≤50,000đ |
| 6 | 20,000,000đ | 800 | 25,000đ | ≤30,000đ |

**Target:** Giảm CAC 50% trong 6 tháng (economies of scale + organic growth)

---

### 2.2 Customer Acquisition by Channel

**Track separately for each channel:**

| Channel | CAC Target | Conversion Rate Target |
|---------|-----------|------------------------|
| Facebook Ads | 50,000đ | 2-3% |
| Google Ads | 60,000đ | 3-5% |
| Referral | 15,000đ | 25% |
| Organic/SEO | 5,000đ | 10% |
| Partnerships | 30,000đ | 15% |

**Action:** Pause channels với CAC >70k, double down on <30k channels

---

### 2.3 New vs Returning Customers

**Month 1:**
- New: 100%
- Returning: 0%

**Month 3:**
- New: 70%
- Returning: 30%

**Month 6 (Target):**
- New: 50%
- Returning: 50%

**Why important:** Returning customers = lower CAC + higher LTV

---

## 3. CUSTOMER RETENTION METRICS

### 3.1 Repeat Purchase Rate

**Formula:** (Customers who ordered 2+ times / Total customers) x 100

| Month | Repeat Rate Target | Cohort | Orders |
|-------|-------------------|--------|--------|
| 1 | 10% | 300 | 330 |
| 3 | 30% | 1,000 | 1,300 |
| 6 | 50% | 2,000 | 3,000 |

**Tactics to improve:**
- Loyalty program rewards
- Email remarketing
- Personalized offers

---

### 3.2 Order Frequency

**Average orders per customer per month:**

| Customer Tier | Month 1 | Month 3 | Month 6 |
|---------------|---------|---------|---------|
| One-time | 1 | 1 | 1 |
| Occasional (2-5/mo) | 2 | 3 | 4 |
| Regular (6-10/mo) | 6 | 7 | 8 |
| VIP (11+/mo) | 12 | 15 | 20 |

**Goal:** Move customers up tiers via loyalty incentives

---

### 3.3 Churn Rate

**Formula:** (Customers inactive 30 days / Total customers) x 100

**Target:** <20% monthly churn

**Cohort Analysis Example (Month 3):**
- Month 1 cohort (300 customers): 180 still active = 60% retention
- Month 2 cohort (500 customers): 400 still active = 80% retention

**Win-back Campaign:** Email/SMS to inactive >21 days với special offer

---

### 3.4 Customer Lifetime Value (LTV)

**Formula:** Avg Order Value x Order Frequency x Customer Lifespan

**Month 1:**
- AOV: 40k
- Frequency: 1 order/month
- Lifespan: 3 months (projected)
- **LTV: 120,000đ**

**Month 6 (Target):**
- AOV: 50k
- Frequency: 8 orders/month (regulars)
- Lifespan: 12 months
- **LTV: 4,800,000đ**

**LTV:CAC Ratio:**
- Month 1: 120k / 67k = 1.8:1 (breakeven)
- Month 6: 4.8M / 25k = 192:1 (excellent)

---

