### 4.2 Paid Advertising Metrics

#### Facebook Ads

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Click-Through Rate (CTR) | >2% |
| Cost Per Click (CPC) | <5,000đ |
| Conversion Rate | >3% |
| Cost Per Acquisition (CPA) | <50,000đ |
| Return on Ad Spend (ROAS) | >3:1 |

**Daily Monitoring:** Pause ads với ROAS <2:1

---

#### Google Ads

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Quality Score | >7/10 |
| CTR | >5% |
| CPC | <8,000đ |
| Conversion Rate | >4% |
| CPA | <60,000đ |
| ROAS | >4:1 |

---

### 4.3 Email Marketing Metrics

| Metric | Benchmark | Target |
|--------|-----------|--------|
| Open Rate | 20-25% | 30% |
| Click Rate | 3-5% | 7% |
| Conversion Rate | 2-3% | 5% |
| Unsubscribe Rate | <1% | <0.5% |

**Campaigns:**
- Welcome series: 40% open, 10% click
- Menu broadcast: 30% open, 5% click
- Promo emails: 35% open, 8% click

---

## 5. OPERATIONAL METRICS

### 5.1 Delivery Performance

| Metric | Target | Critical Threshold |
|--------|--------|-------------------|
| Avg Delivery Time | 25 min | <30 min |
| On-time Delivery Rate | 95% | >90% |
| Failed Delivery Rate | <2% | <5% |
| Customer Complaints (delivery) | <3% | <5% |

**SLA:** Giao trong 30 phút hoặc FREE (compensation)

---

### 5.2 Food Quality Metrics

| Metric | Target | Measurement |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| Food Quality Rating (1-5★) | 4.5★ | Post-order survey |
| Taste Satisfaction | >90% | "Good" or "Excellent" |
| Portion Size Satisfaction | >85% | Survey |
| Packaging Quality | >90% | Survey + complaints |
| Food Temperature on Arrival | >80% hot | Survey |

**Action:** Investigate if any metric drops below target for 3 consecutive days

---

### 5.3 Customer Service Metrics

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Avg Response Time (Chat/Message) | <5 min |
| First Response Time | <2 min |
| Resolution Time | <15 min |
| Customer Satisfaction (CSAT) | >90% |
| Net Promoter Score (NPS) | >50 |

**NPS Question:** "Bạn có giới thiệu Cơm Ánh Dương cho bạn bè không? (0-10)"
- Promoters (9-10): >60%
- Passives (7-8): <30%
- Detractors (0-6): <10%

---

## 6. REVIEW & REPUTATION METRICS

### 6.1 Online Reviews

| Platform | Month 1 | Month 3 | Month 6 |
|----------|---------|---------|---------|
| Google My Business | 10 reviews, 4.5★ | 50 reviews, 4.6★ | 150 reviews, 4.7★ |
| Facebook Page | 15 reviews, 4.4★ | 60 reviews, 4.6★ | 180 reviews, 4.7★ |
| Foody.vn | 5 reviews, 4.3★ | 30 reviews, 4.5★ | 100 reviews, 4.6★ |

**Targets:**
- Total reviews: 200+ by Month 6
- Average rating: >4.5★ across all platforms
- Review response rate: 100%
- Avg response time: <24 hours

---

### 6.2 Sentiment Analysis

**Track monthly:**
- % Positive reviews (4-5★): >80%
- % Neutral reviews (3★): <15%
- % Negative reviews (1-2★): <5%

**Common positive keywords:** "ngon", "nhanh", "sạch", "giống cơm nhà"
**Common negative keywords:** "chậm", "lạnh", "ít"

**Action:** Address negative themes in operations

---

## 7. FINANCIAL METRICS

### 7.1 Profitability Metrics

**Gross Margin:**
```
Revenue: 40,000đ/order
COGS (food cost): 18,000đ (45%)
Gross Profit: 22,000đ (55%)
```

**Target:** Maintain 50-55% gross margin

---

**Operating Expenses (per order):**
```
Delivery cost: 5,000đ
Packaging: 2,000đ
Labor (per order): 3,000đ
Marketing (amortized): 2,000đ
Overhead: 2,000đ
Total OpEx: 14,000đ
```

**Net Profit per order:** 8,000đ (20% net margin)

**Target:** 20-25% net margin

---

### 7.2 Cash Flow Metrics

**Daily Cash Flow (Month 3 example):**
```
Revenue: 100 orders x 45,000đ = 4,500,000đ
Daily costs: 100 orders x 32,000đ = 3,200,000đ
Daily profit: 1,300,000đ
Monthly profit: ~39,000,000đ
```

**Break-even point:** 50 orders/day (Month 2)

---

### 7.3 Return on Investment (ROI)

**Marketing ROI:**
```
Month 1:
Marketing spend: 20M
Revenue from marketing: 30M
ROI: (30M - 20M) / 20M = 50%

Month 6:
Marketing spend: 20M
Revenue from marketing: 140M
ROI: (140M - 20M) / 20M = 600%
```

**Target:** >300% ROI by Month 6

---

## 8. GROWTH METRICS

### 8.1 Month-over-Month Growth Rate

**Formula:** ((This Month - Last Month) / Last Month) x 100

| Metric | Month 1→2 | Month 2→3 | Month 3→6 Avg |
|--------|-----------|-----------|---------------|
| Orders | +100% | +67% | +40% |
| Revenue | +110% | +78% | +50% |
| New Customers | +67% | +40% | +30% |
| Social Followers | +150% | +100% | +50% |

**Benchmark:** Sustain >30% MoM growth for first 6 months

---

### 8.2 Market Penetration

**Total Addressable Market (TAM):**
- Office workers in service area: ~200,000 people
- Conversion potential: 5% = 10,000 customers
- Month 6 target: 2,000 customers = 20% penetration

**Service Area Expansion:**
- Month 1-3: Phường 1, 2, 3, 4, Tân Quy Đông (TP. Sa Đéc)
- Month 4-6: Add Phường An Hòa, Xã Tân Phú Đông
- Month 7+: Add Lai Vung, Lấp Vò (lân cận)

---

## 9. DASHBOARD SETUP

### 9.1 Daily Dashboard (Check every morning)

**Revenue Metrics:**
- [ ] Yesterday's orders
- [ ] Yesterday's revenue
- [ ] AOV (trending up/down?)

**Operational Metrics:**
- [ ] Avg delivery time
- [ ] Failed deliveries
- [ ] Customer complaints

**Marketing Metrics:**
- [ ] Facebook ad ROAS
- [ ] Website visitors
- [ ] New signups

---

### 9.2 Weekly Dashboard (Monday review)

**Customer Metrics:**
- Orders by day of week
- New vs returning customers
- Repeat rate (7-day cohort)

**Marketing Performance:**
- Social media engagement
- Email campaign results
- Top traffic sources

**Product Performance:**
- Top 10 selling dishes
- Underperforming dishes (consider removing)

---

### 9.3 Monthly Dashboard (End of month)

**Business Health:**
- Monthly revenue vs target
- Profitability (net margin)
- Customer acquisition cost
- Customer lifetime value
- LTV:CAC ratio

**Growth Metrics:**
- MoM growth rate
- New customer count
- Retention rate
- Churn rate

**Marketing ROI:**
- Spend by channel
- Revenue by channel
- ROAS by channel
- Channel optimization recommendations

---

## 10. REPORTING SCHEDULE

### Daily (8:00 AM):
**Audience:** Operations team
**Format:** Slack message
**Metrics:** Orders, revenue, delivery performance

---

### Weekly (Monday 9:00 AM):
**Audience:** Full team
**Format:** Google Slides presentation (5 slides)
**Metrics:**
1. Revenue summary
2. Customer acquisition
3. Marketing performance
4. Operations quality
5. Next week priorities

---

### Monthly (1st of month):
**Audience:** Stakeholders/Investors
**Format:** PDF report (10 pages)
**Contents:**
1. Executive summary
2. Financial performance
3. Customer metrics
4. Marketing performance
5. Operational excellence
6. Growth analysis
7. Challenges & solutions
8. Next month plan
9. Budget allocation
10. Appendix (raw data)

---

## 11. ALERTS & THRESHOLDS

### Red Alerts (Immediate action required):

🚨 Daily orders <20 (below breakeven)
🚨 Avg delivery time >35 min
🚨 Customer rating <4.0★
🚨 Facebook ad ROAS <1.5:1
🚨 Churn rate >30%
🚨 Negative reviews >10% in a week

**Action:** Emergency team meeting within 2 hours

---

### Yellow Alerts (Monitor closely):

⚠️ Orders -10% vs last week
⚠️ CAC >70,000đ
⚠️ Repeat rate <20%
⚠️ Social engagement -20%
⚠️ Delivery complaints >5%

**Action:** Investigate within 24 hours, create action plan

---

## 12. A/B TESTING METRICS

**Always Be Testing:**

| Test | Variants | Success Metric | Duration |
|------|----------|----------------|----------|
| Menu pricing | 35k vs 40k | Orders + Revenue | 2 weeks |
| Promo messaging | "20% off" vs "Giảm 20%" | CTR | 1 week |
| Delivery fee | Free >50k vs Free >40k | AOV | 2 weeks |
| Order button color | Red vs Green | Conversion | 1 week |
| Email subject | "Menu hôm nay" vs "Đói chưa?" | Open rate | 3 days |

**Rule:** Winner = >10% improvement with 95% statistical significance

---

## SUMMARY

**North Star Metric:** Daily Orders
**Primary KPIs:**
1. Revenue growth
2. Customer acquisition cost
3. Repeat purchase rate
4. Net Promoter Score
5. Delivery time

**Review Frequency:**
- Daily: Operations metrics
- Weekly: Marketing + customer metrics
- Monthly: Business health + growth

**Tool Stack:**
- Google Analytics (web traffic)
- Facebook Ads Manager (ads performance)
- Custom dashboard (order data from database)
- Google Sheets (manual tracking + charts)

---

**Next Steps:**
1. Setup tracking tools (Analytics, pixels)
2. Create dashboard templates
3. Train team on metrics
4. Schedule first weekly review

