# Promotional Campaigns - Cơm Ánh Dương

**Tài liệu:** Chiến dịch khuyến mãi chi tiết
**Version:** 1.0
**Last Updated:** 2026-01-31

---

## Campaign Calendar Overview

| Tháng | Campaign | Type | Budget | Expected ROI |
|-------|----------|------|--------|--------------|
| 1-2 | Grand Opening | Launch | 10M | 3:1 |
| 2-3 | Loyalty Program | Retention | 5M | 5:1 |
| 3-6 | Referral | Acquisition | 8M | 4:1 |
| Yearly | Seasonal | Various | 15M | 4:1 |

---

## 1. GRAND OPENING CAMPAIGN (Tuần 1-2)

### Objective:
- First customer acquisition
- Create buzz and awareness
- Database building

### Timeline:
**Soft Launch:** Week 1 (testing, friends & family)
**Hard Launch:** Week 2 (public, paid ads)

---

### Promotion Details:

#### A. First-Timer Discount
**Offer:** GIẢM 20% ĐƠN ĐẦU TIÊN
**Terms:**
- Áp dụng cho khách hàng mới
- Đơn tối thiểu: 50,000đ
- Max discount: 30,000đ
- Code: `CHAOBAN20`

**Mechanics:**
1. Customer đặt đơn đầu tiên
2. Nhập code `CHAOBAN20`
3. Giảm 20% tự động
4. Lưu thông tin vào database (email/phone)

**Budget:** 5,000,000đ (ước tính 167 đơn x 30k discount)

---

#### B. Free Delivery Week
**Offer:** MIỄN PHÍ SHIP TẤT CẢ ĐƠN
**Terms:**
- Áp dụng: Week 1-2
- Không giới hạn số lần
- Bán kính: 5km từ kitchen

**Mechanics:**
- Tự động free ship khi checkout
- Không cần code

**Budget:** 3,000,000đ (1000 đơn x 3k phí ship)

---

#### C. Bundle Deal
**Offer:** COMBO VĂN PHÒNG (5 SUẤT)
**Terms:**
- 5 suất cơm (tự chọn món)
- Giá gốc: 200,000đ
- Giá KM: 150,000đ (Giảm 25%)
- Free ship

**Target:** Company orders, team lunch

**Budget:** 2,000,000đ (40 combo x 50k discount)

---

### Marketing Execution:

**Week 1 (Soft Launch):**
- Organic posts on Facebook
- Zalo message to contacts
- Free samples to building security
- Flyers tại văn phòng gần

**Week 2 (Hard Launch):**
- Facebook Ads: 3M budget
  - Targeting: 5km radius, 22-45 age
  - Objective: Conversions
  - Ad creative: Video testimonials + food photos
- Google Ads: 1M budget
  - Keywords: "cơm ship gần đây", "cơm văn phòng"
- TikTok: Organic videos (#KhaiTrươngCơmÁnhDương)

**Total Budget:** 10,000,000đ
**Expected Orders:** 300-500 first-time customers
**Expected Revenue:** 15-25M

---

## 2. LOYALTY PROGRAM (Month 2+)

### Objective:
- Increase repeat purchase rate
- Build customer lifetime value
- Reduce customer acquisition cost

---

### Program Structure: "THÀNH VIÊN NHÀ"

#### Tier 1: BẠC (0-5 đơn)
**Benefits:**
- Tích điểm 5% giá trị đơn hàng
- Birthday gift: 50k voucher
- Email weekly menu trước

**Example:** Đơn 40k → tích 2k điểm

---

#### Tier 2: VÀNG (6-15 đơn)
**Benefits:**
- Tích điểm 8% giá trị đơn hàng
- Free ship tất cả đơn
- Birthday gift: 100k voucher
- Priority delivery
- 1 suất miễn phí/tháng (đơn >50k)

**Example:** Đơn 40k → tích 3.2k điểm + free ship 3k

---

#### Tier 3: KIM CƯƠNG (16+ đơn)
**Benefits:**
- Tích điểm 10% giá trị đơn hàng
- Free ship tất cả đơn
- Birthday gift: 200k voucher
- VIP customer service line
- 2 suất miễn phí/tháng
- Early access menu mới
- Exclusive events (tour bếp, nấu ăn cùng chef)

**Example:** Đơn 40k → tích 4k điểm + free ship + ưu tiên

---

### Points Redemption:
- 100 điểm = 10,000đ giá trị
- Min redeem: 50 điểm (5k)
- Points expiry: 12 tháng

### Special Loyalty Offers:

#### "MUA 10 TẶNG 1"
**Mechanics:**
- Stamp card: Mỗi đơn >40k = 1 stamp
- 10 stamps → 1 suất free (trị giá 40k)
- Digital tracking via app/website

**Budget:** 1,500,000đ/month (assume 300 members x 5k average)

---

#### "THÁNG NÀY ĂN BAO NHIÊU?"
**Mechanics:**
- Top 10 customers by order count/month
- Prize: Free cơm cả tháng sau (1 suất/day)
- Announced end of month

**Budget:** 1,200,000đ/month (10 people x 30 days x 40k = 12M/year)

---

### Implementation:

**Tech Requirements:**
- CRM system to track orders
- Points dashboard (customer portal)
- Automated birthday emails
- Tier upgrade notifications

**Communication:**
- Email: Monthly points statement
- SMS: Tier upgrade congrats
- Push notification: Points expiry warning

**Total Budget:** 5,000,000đ/month
**Expected Impact:**
- Repeat rate: 20% → 50%
- Order frequency: 2x/month → 8x/month
- LTV increase: 3x

---

## 3. REFERRAL PROGRAM (Month 3+)

### Objective:
- Word-of-mouth acquisition
- Viral growth
- Lower CAC (25k → 15k)

---

### Program: "GIỚI THIỆU BẠN - CÙNG NHẬN QUÀ"

#### Referrer (Người giới thiệu):
**Reward:** 30,000đ voucher
**Terms:**
- Friend must be new customer
- Friend must complete 1st order (min 50k)
- Max 10 referrals/month
- Voucher valid 30 days

---

#### Referee (Người được giới thiệu):
**Reward:** 20,000đ discount on 1st order
**Terms:**
- New customer only
- Min order 50k
- One-time use

---

### Mechanics:

**Step 1:** Customer gets unique referral link
**Step 2:** Share link to friends (Zalo, Messenger, SMS)
**Step 3:** Friend clicks link → tracked by cookie/app
**Step 4:** Friend places order → both get rewards automatically

**Tracking:** UTM parameters + customer ID in URL

**Example URL:**
`https://comanhduong.com?ref=ANH123&utm_source=referral`

---

### Marketing Execution:

**Month 3:**
- Announce program via email to all customers
- Facebook post explaining mechanics
- In-app banner promoting referral
- SMS to top customers

**Ongoing:**
- Reminder emails monthly
- Leaderboard: "Top referrers this month"
- Bonus for top 3: Extra 100k voucher

**Total Budget:** 8,000,000đ
**Expected Referrals:** 400 new customers (200 referrers x 2)
**Expected Revenue:** 32M (400 orders x 80k average - 20k discount)

---

## 4. SEASONAL CAMPAIGNS

### 4.1 TẾT NGUYÊN ĐÁN (Feb)

**Campaign:** "MẸ LO CƠM TẾT"

**Offers:**
- **Pre-order Tết Menu:** Giảm 15% đơn >500k
- **Catering packages:** Tray 10-20 người
- **Gift sets:** Bánh chưng + cơm + đồ khô

**Special Menu:**
- Thịt kho tàu
- Nem rán
- Gà luộc
- Bánh chưng

**Budget:** 5M
**Timeline:** 2 weeks before Tết
**Expected Revenue:** 50M

---

### 4.2 QUỐC TẾ PHỤ NỮ 8/3 (March)

**Campaign:** "MẸ NGHỈ NGÀY 8/3"

**Offers:**
- **Flash Sale:** Giảm 30% tất cả đơn (10:00-11:00)
- **Free rose:** Tặng hoa hồng mỗi đơn
- **Special set:** Cơm + dessert + trà sữa (phụ nữ yêu thích)

**Budget:** 3M
**Timeline:** 8/3 only
**Expected Revenue:** 15M

---

### 4.3 NGÀY GIA ĐÌNH VIỆT NAM 28/6 (June)

**Campaign:** "CƠM GIA ĐÌNH ẤM ÁP"

**Offers:**
- **Family Combo 4:** 4 suất + canh + trái cây (Giảm 20%)
- **Family Combo 6:** 6 suất + canh + trái cây + dessert (Giảm 25%)

**Budget:** 2M
**Timeline:** 28/6 + weekend
**Expected Revenue:** 10M

---

### 4.4 BACK TO SCHOOL (September)

**Campaign:** "CƠM CHO CON ĂN TRƯA"

**Target:** Phụ huynh học sinh

**Offers:**
- **Student Package:** 20 suất/tháng (Giảm 15%)
- **Healthy Menu:** Dinh dưỡng cho trẻ
- **Mom's Note:** Ghi lời nhắn trên hộp cơm

**Budget:** 2M
**Timeline:** September
**Expected Revenue:** 20M

---

### 4.5 NOEL (December)

**Campaign:** "GIÁNG SINH ẤM ÁP"

**Offers:**
- **Christmas Combo:** Western + Vietnamese fusion
- **Secret Santa:** Lucky draw mỗi đơn (Prize: Free cơm 1 tháng)

**Budget:** 3M
**Timeline:** Dec 20-25
**Expected Revenue:** 25M

---

## 5. FLASH SALES & LIMITED TIME OFFERS

### Weekly Flash Sale (Every Friday)
**Time:** 12:00-13:00 (1 hour only)
**Offer:** Giảm 30% tất cả đơn
**Limit:** First 50 orders
**Announcement:** Thursday evening (create urgency)

**Budget:** 1M/month (4 weeks x 50 orders x 5k discount)

---

### Rainy Day Special
**Trigger:** Heavy rain alert
**Offer:** Free soup with every order
**Mechanics:** Automated via weather API

**Budget:** 500k/month

---

### "Sell Out Before We Close"
**Time:** 19:00-20:00 (last hour)
**Offer:** Buy 1 get 1 (remaining food only)
**Goal:** Zero waste

**Budget:** 800k/month

---

## 6. PARTNERSHIP CAMPAIGNS

### 6.1 Office Building Partnerships
**Target:** 10+ office buildings with 100+ employees

**Offer:**
- 15% discount for all building employees
- Free delivery to building
- Monthly menu presentation
- Exclusive lunch hours

**Implementation:**
- Sign MOU with building management
- Issue employee ID verification
- Monthly invoice for corporate accounts

**Budget:** 2M/month
**Expected Revenue:** 30M/month (500 orders x 60k)

---

### 6.2 Co-working Space Partnerships
**Target:** Toong, Dreamplex, CirCO, etc.

**Offer:**
- In-space menu display
- QR code ordering
- 10% discount for members
- Catering for events

**Budget:** 1M/month
**Expected Revenue:** 10M/month

---

### 6.3 Gym Partnership (Healthy Meal)
**Target:** Fitness gyms with nutrition focus

**Offer:**
- Low-carb, high-protein menu
- Macro-counted meals
- 10% discount for gym members

**Budget:** 500k/month
**Expected Revenue:** 5M/month

---

## 7. CAMPAIGN PERFORMANCE TRACKING

### Key Metrics:

| Campaign | Metric | Target |
|----------|--------|--------|
| Grand Opening | First-time customers | 500 |
| Loyalty | Repeat rate | 50% |
| Referral | Referred customers | 400 |
| Seasonal | Revenue uplift | +30% |
| Flash Sales | Conversion rate | 40% |

---

### A/B Testing Plan:

**Test 1:** Discount % (20% vs 30%)
**Test 2:** Free shipping vs Free item
**Test 3:** Code vs Auto-apply
**Test 4:** Email vs SMS vs Push
**Test 5:** Urgency (24h vs 1 week)

---

### Reporting:

**Weekly:**
- Campaign performance dashboard
- Redemption rate
- Customer feedback

**Monthly:**
- ROI analysis
- Customer cohort retention
- Recommendations for next month

---

## 8. BUDGET SUMMARY (Year 1)

| Campaign Type | Budget | Expected Revenue | ROI |
|---------------|--------|------------------|-----|
| Grand Opening | 10M | 30M | 3:1 |
| Loyalty Program | 60M (12 months) | 300M | 5:1 |
| Referral Program | 24M (8 months) | 96M | 4:1 |
| Seasonal (5 events) | 15M | 120M | 8:1 |
| Flash Sales | 12M (12 months) | 60M | 5:1 |
| Partnerships | 42M (12 months) | 540M | 13:1 |
| **TOTAL** | **163M** | **1,146M** | **7:1** |

---

## 9. RISK MANAGEMENT

### Risk 1: Over-redemption
**Mitigation:** Cap daily redemptions, require min purchase

### Risk 2: Fraud (fake referrals)
**Mitigation:** Verify phone/email, track IP, manual review suspicious

### Risk 3: Budget overrun
**Mitigation:** Daily budget caps, pause campaigns if threshold reached

### Risk 4: Low engagement
**Mitigation:** A/B test offers, increase communication, simplify mechanics

---

## 10. NEXT STEPS

**Week 1:**
- [ ] Finalize promo codes in system
- [ ] Create tracking links
- [ ] Design campaign creatives
- [ ] Setup Google Analytics goals

**Week 2:**
- [ ] Train staff on promo handling
- [ ] Test redemption flow
- [ ] Prepare customer service FAQs
- [ ] Launch Grand Opening campaign

**Month 2:**
- [ ] Analyze Month 1 data
- [ ] Launch Loyalty Program
- [ ] Prepare Seasonal campaigns

